# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 检出后 Linux 上出现 CRLF 导致的执行失败
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary

# 语言统计
*.js   text
*.mjs  text
*.json text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.md   text
